[[File:Seed dibber detail.png|left|120px]]
A '''seed dibber''' is used to plant [[seed]]s in [[Farming]] [[Farming/Patch locations|patches]]. Up to 100 can be stored with [[tool leprechaun]]s near Farming patches. They can be purchased from [[farming shop]]s or any [[Group of Advanced Gardeners|farmer]] that protects patches. An unlimited amount can be taken from a [[tool store 5]].

Completion of the Farming portion of the [[Barbarian Training]] [[miniquest]] allows players to plant seeds without requiring a seed dibber.

A seed dibber is required for the quests: [[Grim Tales]], [[Forgettable Tale...]], [[My Arm's Big Adventure]], [[Garden of Tranquillity]], [[A Tail of Two Cats]], and [[While Guthix Sleeps]].

